### AfriDev Hub — REST Client (VS Code)
### Extension requise : REST Client (humao.rest-client)
###
### Ordre conseillé : Register → Login → le reste.
### Les tokens viennent de la requête "login" (chaînage REST Client) : il suffit
### de l'exécuter pour mettre à jour les tokens utilisés plus bas.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@contentType = application/json

# ─── Variables ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pseudo utilisé pour GET /users/:username
@username = idy_dev

# IDs à remplir au fil des tests (copier depuis les réponses)
@postId       = PASTE_POST_ID_HERE
@answerId     = PASTE_ANSWER_ID_HERE
@projectId    = PASTE_PROJECT_ID_HERE
@jobId        = PASTE_JOB_ID_HERE


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AUTH
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### [Story 2.1] Register
# username : 3–30 car., lettres/chiffres/_/- uniquement
# password : 8+ car., au moins une majuscule, une minuscule et un chiffre
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "idy_dev",
  "email": "idy@gtech.sn",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

###

### [Story 2.1] Login  (requête nommée "login" : ses tokens sont réutilisés ci-dessous)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "idy@gtech.sn",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

###

### Refresh token
# Lit le refreshToken depuis la réponse du login (enveloppe AD-7 : { data: { … } }).
# ATTENTION : chaque refresh révoque l'ancien refresh token. Relancer "login"
# si une requête suivante renvoie 401 après un refresh.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Me (profil du token courant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

###

### Logout
# Pas de body : le DTO RefreshTokenDto n'a pas de validateur, donc le
# ValidationPipe (forbidNonWhitelisted) rejette tout champ envoyé.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# USERS / PROFILES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### [Story 2.1] Get public profile (tracer bullet)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{username}}

###

### Update my profile
# Tous les champs sont optionnels. websiteUrl doit être une URL valide.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "displayName": "Idrissa Wade",
  "bio": "Fullstack Dev — CTO at GTECH Sénégal",
  "githubUsername": "TheShvdow",
  "linkedinUsername": "idrissa-wade",
  "twitterUsername": "theshvdowsn",
  "location": "Saint-Louis",
  "websiteUrl": "https://www.idrissawade.com"
}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# FORUM — Posts
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List posts (page, limit ≤ 50, sort: newest|votes|unanswered|active, tag, search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts?page=1&limit=20&sort=newest

###

### Get post by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}

###

### Create post
# title : 15–200 car. | body : 50–50000 car. | tags : requis, 1 à 5
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Comment configurer Prisma avec Neon sur NestJS ?",
  "body": "J'essaie de connecter Prisma 5 à Neon DB dans un monorepo Nx, mais les migrations échouent…",
  "tags": ["prisma", "nestjs", "neon"]
}

###

### Update post (tous les champs optionnels, mêmes contraintes)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Comment configurer Prisma 5 avec Neon sur NestJS 10 ?",
  "body": "Contenu mis à jour : ajout de directUrl dans le schéma Prisma."
}

###

### Delete post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# FORUM — Answers
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Create answer
# body : 30–50000 car.
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "body": "Tu dois ajouter `directUrl` dans le schéma Prisma pour Neon, puis lancer la migration."
}

###

### Accept answer
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/forum/answers/{{answerId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

###

### Delete answer
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/forum/answers/{{answerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# VOTES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Route = /votes/posts/:id ou /votes/answers/:id ; body = { "value": "UP" | "DOWN" } (enum VoteValue)

### Vote UP on a post
POST {{baseUrl}}/votes/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "value": "UP"
}

###

### Vote DOWN on an answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/votes/answers/{{answerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "value": "DOWN"
}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PROJECTS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

###

### Get project by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}

###

### Create project
# name : 5–120 car. | description : 50–10000 car. | country : ISO alpha-2 | repoUrl : URL requise | demoUrl : URL optionnelle
# tags : requis, 1 à 5 | categorySlug : optionnel (doit exister en base, sinon 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "AfriDev Hub",
  "description": "Plateforme communautaire open-source pour les développeurs africains : forum, vitrine de projets et offres d'emploi.",
  "country": "SN",
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/TheShvdow/afridev_hub",
  "tags": ["NestJS", "Prisma", "PostgreSQL", "Angular"]
}

###

### Star project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/star
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

###

### [Admin] Approve project  (rôle ADMIN requis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

###

### [Admin] Reject project  (rôle ADMIN requis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# JOBS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List jobs (filtres optionnels : type, mode, search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?page=1&limit=20&type=FULL_TIME&mode=REMOTE

###

### Get job by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}

###

### Create job
# title : 5–120 | description : 100–20000 car. | company : ≤100
# country : code ISO alpha-2 (ex. SN) | type : FULL_TIME | PART_TIME | CONTRACT | FREELANCE | INTERNSHIP
# mode : REMOTE | ONSITE | HYBRID
# salaryMin/salaryMax : entiers positifs, requis | currency : ISO 4217 (ex. XOF), requis
# stack : requis, 1 à 5
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Développeur NestJS Senior",
  "description": "Nous recherchons un développeur NestJS senior pour renforcer notre équipe produit : conception d'API REST, modélisation avec Prisma et déploiement Docker sur PostgreSQL.",
  "company": "GTECH Sénégal",
  "country": "SN",
  "type": "FULL_TIME",
  "mode": "REMOTE",
  "salaryMin": 500000,
  "salaryMax": 800000,
  "currency": "XOF",
  "stack": ["NestJS", "PostgreSQL", "Docker"]
}

###

### Apply to job
# message : requis | cvUrl : optionnel (URL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "Motivé par ce poste, 3 ans d'expérience NestJS.",
  "cvUrl": "https://idrissawade.com/cv.pdf"
}

###

### [Recruiter] Get applications for a job  (auteur de l'offre uniquement)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

###
